" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"66\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-66\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> orbitals</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
